  "title": {
    "zh": "熄灯前的三件货",
    "en": "Last-Light Extraction"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "逃脱 · 三件货、多闸、三名对手",
    "en": "Escape · Three cargos, shutters and three rivals"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "三件货各安排一次转仓。云母始终追击，瓷轮和铃铛把守各自的巡线。电池拾取也要消耗一个行动。收齐 3 件标记货物，带到标出的出口。避开 3 台追击或巡线的对手；同格或相向换位都会被拦下。首张地图限 34 回合，复测限 30 回合。 第 4, 9, 14 回合结束时切换通道并转移未取的货物；占用的门当次保持开启。从容模式须用同一程序通过两张地图。 控制台的 A、B 调度表列出两局地形、货物、机器人起点和调闸坐标。 巡线表 cycle 从第 0 回合起依次循环。追击机每回合向芽芽上回合的位置走一步；最短路线并列时按上、右、下、左选。",
    "en": "Each of the three loads is scheduled to transfer once. Mica pursues while Porcelain and Bell cover their patrol tracks. Picking up a battery costs a full action. Recover all 3 marked items and reach the marked exit. Avoid 3 chasing or patrolling rivals. Sharing a tile or swapping positions with one ends the run. The first map allows 34 turns and the second allows 30. After turns 4, 9, 14, gates change and unclaimed cargo is transferred. Occupied gates stay open for that shift. In Relaxed mode, win both maps with the same program. The A and B schedule cards include both maps, cargo, rival starts and gate coordinates. Patrol cycles start at turn 0. Chasers step toward your previous position, breaking shortest-path ties up, right, down, left."
  },
